The statement is most transparent from a Schmidt decomposition, $\begin{aligned}
\ket{\Psi}_{AB}
&=\sum_{r=1}^{R}\sqrt{\lambda_r}
\ket{r}_A\ket{r}_B,\\
\lambda_r&\geq0,
\qquad
\sum_r\lambda_r=1.
\end{aligned}$ for which $\rho_A=\sum_{r=1}^{R}\lambda_r\ket{r}_A\bra{r}.$ The Schmidt rank $R$ is one for a product state and exceeds one for an entangled pure state.

